('e2f81597-9c60-5da1-aac6-288e5167f42a', NULL, 'quantitative', 'ratios', 1, '₹2,000 is divided between A and B in the ratio 2:3. What is B''s share?', '["₹800","₹1,600","₹1,000","₹1,200"]', 3, 'B gets 3/5 of ₹2,000 = ₹1,200.'),
