('e86fc7fd-fffc-543d-bbb7-2eb8741cfa8e', NULL, 'quantitative', 'profit-loss', 2, 'An item bought for ₹800 is sold at a 10% profit. What is the selling price?', '["₹900","₹880","₹930","₹720"]', 1, 'SP = CP × (1 + 10/100) = ₹880.'),
