('ff25af44-14f6-5d49-9e54-a57486e01d4a', NULL, 'quantitative', 'speed-distance', 1, 'A train travels 180 km at 60 km/h. How many hours does the journey take?', '["3","4","2.5","1.8"]', 0, 'Time = distance ÷ speed = 180/60 = 3 h.'),
